  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting the rights of relgious minorities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work for the improved recognition and implementation of the rights of religious and ethnic minorities at the local, national, regional and international levels, and systematically combat discrimination and negative stereotyping against religious communities in the region. 

The project will target minority activists and human right defenders in Lebanon, Morocco, Tunisia, Egypt, Iraq, Iran and Syria.</narrative>
  </description>
